    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mystery adventure game made with RPG Maker VX Ace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yamu, an ordinary high school girl, suddenly finds herself chosen as a <strong>candidate for the Queen of Ancient Egypt</strong>. But earning the throne won\u2019t be easy\u2014she must pass a series of <strong>mysterious trials</strong>, face <strong>unknown entities</strong>, and uncover the secrets hidden within this strange world. Surrounded by dangers, with unseen forces testing her every move, Yamu must prove she is worthy. Can she survive the trials and claim her place in history?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle &amp; Exploration</strong> \u2013 Search for clues, solve challenging puzzles, and navigate the unknown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suspenseful Storytelling</strong> \u2013 A gripping narrative filled with mystery and unexpected twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Elements</strong> \u2013 Stay one step ahead of the <strong>mysterious beings</strong> lurking in the shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Pixel Art</strong> \u2013 Cute and expressive 2D characters bring the adventure to life.</p></li></ul>",
